{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/864570-hunter-the-vigil-memento-mori-actual-play","id":864570,"title":"Hunter: the Vigil - Memento Mori [Actual Play]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-12T15:24:10-07:00","id":864570,"title":"Hunter: the Vigil - Memento Mori [Actual Play]","content":"I've decided to start hosting my weekly Roll20 games live and possibly uploading the videos afterwards. I don't know if anyone is interested, but if so you can view it on Twitch TV.<br /> <br /> Every Tuesday from 7-10 PM EST at <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/zomglaserspewpew\" target=\"_blank\">www.twitch.tv/zomglaserspewpew</a><br /> <br /> I am a fairly new Storyteller so I am open to critiques, in fact I would welcome it. Thanks!<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> The game has been going on for a bit already, but I can post a synopsis if anyone is interested. They started out as mortals and eventually it evolved into a Hunter game.<br /> <br /> Here is the PCs.<br /> <br /> <b>Jeph Staraharaja - </b>An extremely talented surgeon who is a bit socially awkward. He lost his sister a year ago when the story started and remained shut in since. He started out as a pacifist who refused to participate in fights except to perform care and relied on pills to stop his hallucinations, but this changed about halfway through the sessions as his descent into madness began. Now he is a Faithful of Shulpae with a hunger that goes beyond the mundane.<br /> <br /> <b>Robert Anselm - </b>Anselm is a thief by trade who had recently gotten out of prison for not throwing a company known as Radcliff Pharmaceuticals under the bus for some corporate espionage he was hired to do. When he got out he followed up with the company to get his due reward for his silence, but instead got caught up investigating the murder of Jessie Cale with the group. Now he is a Knight of Saint Adrian who fights what lurks in the night for a buck.<br /> <br /> <b>Luke Tarantino - </b>A detective who was known for only taking 'weird' cases, his story didn't start at the beginning - he woke up in a ditch with no memories. He found bits and pieces of his past from what he could, but he's pretty sure his last name is fake and doesn't know where to go from here. He went with the group because the ditch was close to the murder was and he hoped to find out the truth. Demonic power awakened within him when he was fighting the vampire who stole his mind, bringing out his true heritage as one of the Lucifuge.<br /> <br /> <b>Jack Lothair - </b>Jack is a street performer with a penchant for taking what isn't his. He grew up in the slums without a care for whatever family was lost to him, but eventually he got word that his dad had no heir besides him and it was time for him to take up the family mantle. He went with it mostly for the money, but he got inducted into the Aegis Kai Doru along the way and was sent to investigate the unhinged PCs who by now were showing mental degradation from their devotion to the Vigil - are they Slashers or Hunters?<br /> <br /> <b>Jayce &quot;JC&quot; Chaimbers - </b>Jayce is the best with putting things together and taking them apart within the group. He grew up simply but especially took to engineering and welding. He caught the attention of Task Force: Valkyrie when he alone survived a supernatural event with just ingenuity, some water and a car battery. He doesn't see the world the way most do, but rather he sees the potential inherit in the items around him. Among the group he is probably the 'purest' of mind. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You can check out my WoD games live every Tuesday from 7-10 PM EST <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/zomglaserspewpew\" target=\"_blank\">here!</a>","edited":{"userid":10319,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10319-flaming-pancakes","user":"Flaming Pancakes","date":". 04-12-2016, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10319-flaming-pancakes","name":"Flaming Pancakes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10319_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}